ine affix, in the Vocative Case singular.\n\nTerms: गुण in Feminine", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["सम्बुद्धौ च ७.३.१०६", "७.३.१०६", "७.३.१०६ सम्बुद्धौ च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["sambudDO ca ७.३.१०६", "७.३.१०६", "७.३.१०६ sambudDO ca"]}], "samaH suwi": [{"id": "samaH suwi", "headword": "समः सुटि", "headword_slp1": "samaH suwi", "fold": "samaH suwi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "रु is substituted for the म् of स्म् (and thereby अँ or अं is substituted for अ) when the augment स् follows in a संहिता ।\n\nTerms: Nasal रु", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["समः सुटि ८.३.५", "८.३.५", "८.३.५ समः सुटि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["samaH suwi ८.३.५", "८.३.५", "८.३.५ samaH suwi"]}], "samaseNguleH saNgaH": [{"id": "samAse'NguleH saNgaH", "headword": "समासेऽङ्गुलेः सङ्गः", "headword_slp1": "samAse'NguleH saNgaH", "fold": "samaseNguleH saNgaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "ष् is substituted for the स् of सङ्ग after the word अङ्गुलि in a compound.\n\nTerms: ष change", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["समासेऽङ्गुलेः सङ्गः ८.३.८०", "८.३.८०", "८.३.८० समासेऽङ्गुलेः सङ्गः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["samAse'NguleH saNgaH ८.३.८०", "८.३.८०", "८.३.८० samAse'NguleH saNgaH"]}]}